-- Top.seg: what each declaration's informal text opens.
-- Notation (opened to expose the shape of a type: "A x", a pair, Id Bool _ true):
--   Cl Cap Sub Eqv Iff OTc tau M scA PsiP Tr LT Tr3 InC BndE Prog Prog1 G2 DCard, and this
--   file's notions: WWi (Def. 4.39: WW_0 = WW n I, WW_{m+1} = W(WW_m) n Omega_{I+m+1}), EI, FI,
--   Inv, ProgOT, allLtAt.
-- Definitions opened where the text says "by definition" or "by computation":
--   ones plusOne plusI iN kN with add consA hd le lt cmp2 ... ((I+m)+1 = I+(m+1): ones-suc,
--   iN-suc); kN omF iN (Omega_I = I: E0, F0; Omega_{I+n} = Omega_{iN n}: kN-ok, kN-up);
--   G app (G_{Omega_1}(Omega_{I+n}) = {}: G-ones, G-kN); allLt (inc-kN);
--   lt cmp2 fwd (I <' I is false: psiI-ww; 1, Omega_1 <' I: om1-ww0); isI (I = I: tau-I,
--   tau-I-hi); isR isSuc isZero and one (Omega_1 in R: psi-ww); omF one (Omega_1: om1-ww0).
plusOne:
plusI:
ones:
iN:
kN:
ones-suc: one ones plusOne and eqT hd ifT add cmp2 fwd guard isZero le lt or consA
iN-suc: fwd other cl1 ifT one iN add ones plusI and cl4 cmp2 hd isZero le lt or suc consA
iN-ok: OTc Cl iN
kN-ok: kN
kN-up: kN
lt-k: Cl
WWi: Cl
EI: Cl
FI:
ag-i: EI
below-ww: Cl Cap Sub Eqv tau OTc
