inv-f: Inv
ww-cap: Cap Cl Eqv EI WWi Iff Sub
rem440: WWi Cap Cl FI
ww0-sub: Sub
om1-ww0: fwd other cl1 one and cl4 cmp2 lt LT Tr Cap Cl cl10 omF WWi
